@startuml
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title B — Main delivery scenario
autonumber
participant "Intake / Relay" as Intake
database "Application Store" as DB
participant "Temporal Service" as Temporal
participant "Workflow / Activities" as Worker
participant "Push / App" as Push
Intake -> DB: Persist event + dedup + StartWorkflow outbox
Intake -> Temporal: StartWorkflow(notification_id)
Temporal -> Temporal: Persist workflow history
Temporal -> Worker: Workflow task
Worker -> Temporal: Schedule push activity + durable ACK timer
Temporal -> Worker: Activity task
Worker -> Worker: Check policy, state and verified contact
Worker -> Push: Send with stable attempt key
Push --> Worker: Accepted (NOT delivered)
Worker -> Temporal: Activity result = PROVIDER_ACCEPTED
Push -> Intake: Authenticated device ACK
Intake -> DB: Durable callback inbox
Intake -> Temporal: Relay Signal(ACK, callback_id)
Temporal -> Worker: Workflow task with ACK
Worker -> Temporal: Record DELIVERED; cancel unstarted work
Worker -> DB: Idempotent projection / audit activity
note over DB,Temporal
Temporal history owns process state.
Application projection may lag.
end note
@enduml
